    "title": "New trial dates set for Kearney man charged with distributing a controlled substance in a school zone - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Brian Neben ,\n15 hours ago KEARNEY — New trial dates have been set for a Kearney man charged with distributing a controlled substance within a school zone following a narcotics investigation. Austin Dean, 29, is charged with distribution of a controlled substance within a school zone – marijuana, a Class 2 felony and distribution of a controlled substance – lysergic acid, a Class 2A felony. Read full article\n1",
